{"meta":{"id":"tt2372220","type":"series","name":"La Reina Blanca","imdb_id":"tt2372220","description":"\"The White Queen\" es una fascinante historia de amor y deseo, traición y asesinatos, en donde se tejen vibrantemente las historias de tres mujeres diferentes pero igualmente perseverantes: Isabel Woodwille, Margarita Beaufort y Anna Neville. En la búsqueda por el poder, conspirarán, manipularán y seducirán en el camino para llegar al trono de Inglaterra.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt2372220.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yMNYyc5PBy4e70AcLsARvJW8NS3.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jozBXE3RBXQroqoduzvaiSebeGB.png","genres":["Drama","War & Politics"],"releaseInfo":"2013","released":"2013-06-16T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"7.7","country":"United Kingdom, United States of America","cast":["Rebecca Ferguson","Max Irons","Amanda Hale","Janet McTeer","James Frain","Tom McKay","Faye Marsay","Juliet Aubrey","Aneurin Barnard","Caroline Goodall","Rupert Graves","Ben Lamb","Michael Maloney","David Oakes","Eve Ponsonby","Eleanor Tomlinson"],"writer":["Philippa Gregory"],"trailers":[{"source":"_N98ojUqInk","type":"Trailer","name":"The White Queen | Official Trailer | STARZ","ytId":"_N98ojUqInk","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"_N98ojUqInk","title":"The White Queen | Official Trailer | STARZ"}],"links":[{"name":"7.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt2372220"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"War & Politics","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=War+%26+Politics"},{"name":"Rebecca Ferguson","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Rebecca%20Ferguson"},{"name":"Max Irons","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Max%20Irons"},{"name":"Am