ry","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/xzXrtl1mdSPUsOJuhJ7DoNOs7Nk.jpg","tmdbId":71571}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":[null,"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syr9yeahdtEBSdiayJi9SFsgmf4.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt2372220:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Enamorada del rey","overview":"Sin un centavo, y con su marido muerto mientras peleaba al servicio de Enrique VI, Elizabeth Woodville sabe que la única esperanza para ella, y para sus dos hijos, es seducir al victorioso Eduardo IV, rey de York.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oVSnVWCcKmRBRtgHoZpI4JnfR7M.jpg","released":"2013-06-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"El precio del poder","overview":"Luego de una pomposa coronación, Elizabeth y su madre se dedican a comprometer con nobles a hermanas y hermanos, con el fin de asegurar a la familia. Pero Warwick ordena la muerte del hermano y el padre de Elizabeth.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6mTMtDiE34Kl7P5yL8ev3W79MGp.jpg","released":"2013-06-23T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"La tormenta","overview":"Margaret Beaufort acuerda unirse a la rebelión contra Eduardo, liderada por Earl de Warwick, con el objetivo de que su hijo llegue al trono.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yf2qwMIy5Y5HEL51diUXZtWfrMv.jpg","released":"2013-06-30T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"La reina mala","overview":"Elizabeth suma cada vez más problemas. Primero, por la noticia de la muerte del hijo de Isabel y George. Luego, por la posible alianza entre Warwick y Margaret de Anjou.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b9iojuNbrRVh6aOsrbITCa5ajW5.jpg","released":"2013-07-07T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"La guerra de primera mano","overview":"Unas mujeres en guerra se vuelven enemigas acérrimas cuando la reina Isabel, Ana Neville y Margarita Beaufort experimentan la brutalidad del campo de batalla.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/92R3jgvSDpsj7eTBeEP8Ak9Jt6Z.jpg","released":"2013-07-14T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Amor y muerte","overview":"Una se casa por amor, la otra por poder político en el momento que Ana y Margarita dan el «sí, quiero». Entretanto, la reina Isabel experimenta una dosis doble de desamor.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eHwh7zhwi6bOznEwG5Yv61Yi8Ut.jpg","released":"2013-07-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Veneno y vino de malvasía","overview":"Ana Neville toma el protagonismo mientras la paranoia comienza a hacer implosionar su familia. El miedo y un brebaje letal amenazan con hacerlos caer como moscas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hI0DsS36bVG5GXgs9aoPz5m6vDy.jpg","released":"2013-07-28T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Larga vida al rey","overview":"Tal vez esperen días oscuros al rey Eduardo, ya que los protagonistas confabulan e intentan llegar a ser reconocidos como «su majestad».","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qhpnJnDgabPiY4KlOvDmZ43wv8k.jpg","released":"2013-08-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Los príncipes en la torre","overview":"Una peligrosa partida de ajedrez comienza mientras Margarita y la reina Isabel traman subyugar a la otra y determinar el destino de los príncipes Eduardo y Ricardo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wset0hp0Jz0GsWjdXos8tl7tsGk.jpg","released":"2013-08-11T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"La batalla final","overview":"Tras llegar a un final culminante para sus viajes, Ana, la reina Isabel y Margarita dan paso a una nueva generación que busca conspirar, manipular y seducir hasta llegar al trono inglés.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dxVKHrPUWhuqNHxEa5KKLXijaRW.jpg","released":"2013-08-18T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"63 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:1","season":0,"episode":1,"title":"The Making of The White Queen","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:2","season":0,"episode":2,"title":"Series Overview","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:3","season":0,"episode":3,"title":"Book to Series","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:4","season":0,"episode":4,"title":"The History Behind The White Queen","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:5","season":0,"episode":5,"title":"The White Queen Set Tour","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:6","season":0,"episode":6,"title":"Queen Elizabeth","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:7","season":0,"episode":7,"title":"King Edward IV","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:8","season":0,"episode":8,"title":"The Heir Apparent","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:9","season":0,"episode":9,"title":"Women in a Man's World","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:10","season":0,"episode":10,"title":"Conjuring Up The White Queen","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:11","season":0,"episode":11,"title":"Dressing the Queen","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:12","season":0,"episode":12,"title":"Sets & Costumes","overview":"Special feature Blu-Ray.","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt2372220:0:13","season":0,"episode":13,"title":"A conversation with Philippa Gregory","overview":"Special feature Blu-Ray","runtime":"60 min"}]}}